  "reviews": [
    {
      "body": "Ran your test on CPU both ways: master dies at the same `AttributeError: 'list' object has no attribute 'shape'`, passes on this branch.\n\nOne thing worth adding to the description: the `avail_numel` line you removed wasn't only crashing. It replaced the correct group sum from the top of the function with `fp32_flat_groups[0].numel()`, and `avail_numel` is what the `offset != avail_numel` check at the end compares against, so with `--debug` that check was looking at the wrong number too.\n\nThe zero-2 debug block at :317 already prints shapes per group, so this just brings stage 3 in line.\n",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/pull/8530#pullrequestreview-5261273309",
      "id": 5261273309,
      "state": "COMMENTED",
      "submitted_at": "2026-09-20T17:47:17Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "alanhuangyoo"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe focused fix matches ZeRO-3 data structures and is covered by an end-to-end converter test.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** None\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nFixes ZeRO-3 checkpoint conversion crashes when debug logging handles optimizer groups.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Log each rank’s optimizer-group shapes correctly.\n- Preserve the existing valid `avail_numel` calculation.\n- Add a CLI regression test for debug export.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `deepspeed/​utils/​zero_to_fp32.py` | Corrects ZeRO-3 debug handling. |\r\n| `tests/​unit/​checkpoint/​test_convert_checkpoint.py` | Adds debug-export regression coverage. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/new/master?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
